 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
 
+| DELETE | `/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` | offboarding, org admins only → 204 |
+
+`DELETE /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` removes the user from every project of the
+organization (archived ones included) and unassigns their tasks there. Callers
+who are not org admins get 403; another organization, or a user outside the
+organization, is 404.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
